    "detailed_description": "<h1>Now with peaceful mode!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Why must we fill the quotas of our corporate overlords when all I want to do is mine in peace?&quot;,\u00a0</i>Tabatha the Mermaid asks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well now you can! Well actually now you can't, as this will be in the full release of the game. But we can officially announce that the full game will come with a peaceful mode! So you can mine all of the underground in Coal LLC at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hooray!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/27c94bdf4f6e0f6aaed940d3e5f1f83e.poster.avif?t=1755598872\" width=616 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/27c94bdf4f6e0f6aaed940d3e5f1f83e.webm?t=1755598872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/27c94bdf4f6e0f6aaed940d3e5f1f83e.mp4?t=1755598872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Coal LLC, your friendly-everyday-evil-coal-mining-corporation. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only a shoddy pickaxe to start, you must hire and promote employees, upgrade equipment and dig deep below the earth to fill your coal quota each day. Or else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/d17d72489aca7955267d35b7dabaee5f.poster.avif?t=1755598872\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/d17d72489aca7955267d35b7dabaee5f.webm?t=1755598872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/d17d72489aca7955267d35b7dabaee5f.mp4?t=1755598872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feed the factories.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The underground world magically refreshes each day, so you must race to mine as much of it and as deeply as you can before nightfall. Using some very exciting and <i>hyper-realistic</i> methods for doing so. Your world might deteriorate as you grow, however.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/fc3780dbc924826b2c88026be08e8bb0.poster.avif?t=1755598872\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/fc3780dbc924826b2c88026be08e8bb0.webm?t=1755598872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/fc3780dbc924826b2c88026be08e8bb0.mp4?t=1755598872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hire BILLIONS  of employees.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You heard that right. Hire and promote employees into specialised roles in your organisation, each type having exciting and game-changing bonuses and equipment. Grow your organisation into hundreds, thousands, millions and even <i><strong>billions </strong></i>of miners willing to go out and bring back coal for the cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/f35a54240660465adb85658f3308997d.poster.avif?t=1755598872\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/f35a54240660465adb85658f3308997d.webm?t=1755598872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/f35a54240660465adb85658f3308997d.mp4?t=1755598872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't be afraid of the consequences.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different maps, professions and tools means endless ways of growing your operation.  Do you have what it takes to grow the greatest coal mining corporation of all time?</p>",
