ht deteriorate as you grow, however.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/fc3780dbc924826b2c88026be08e8bb0.poster.avif?t=1755598872\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/fc3780dbc924826b2c88026be08e8bb0.webm?t=1755598872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/fc3780dbc924826b2c88026be08e8bb0.mp4?t=1755598872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hire BILLIONS  of employees.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You heard that right. Hire and promote employees into specialised roles in your organisation, each type having exciting and game-changing bonuses and equipment. Grow your organisation into hundreds, thousands, millions and even <i><strong>billions </strong></i>of miners willing to go out and bring back coal for the cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/f35a54240660465adb85658f3308997d.poster.avif?t=1755598872\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/f35a54240660465adb85658f3308997d.webm?t=1755598872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/f35a54240660465adb85658f3308997d.mp4?t=1755598872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't be afraid of the consequences.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different maps, professions and tools means endless ways of growing your operation.  Do you have what it takes to grow the greatest coal mining corporation of all time?</p>",
